    <p>T1 still failed the frozen stability window, while T2 passed it. The retained-to-continuation drift magnitude decreased across the declared windows, and the repeat stayed identical. The evidence supports slow thermal settling rather than a persistent unresolved thermal state for Pair 2.</p>
